{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.3,
   "text": "One thing I would say is hard money costs a lot."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.7,
   "end": 4.92,
   "text": "So typically, when you're doing hard money,"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.14,
   "end": 6.66,
   "text": "your interest rate's gonna be significantly higher."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.82,
   "end": 10.02,
   "text": "Like right now, you're probably between 11, 13%"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.02,
   "end": 10.74,
   "text": "on the interest."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.02,
   "end": 12.32,
   "text": "It's usually a shorter term loan."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.54,
   "end": 13.62,
   "text": "Typically, they'll give you six months."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.88,
   "end": 14.88,
   "text": "And then if you go back to them,"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.88,
   "end": 17.52,
   "text": "they'll let you renew if you pay some additional points."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.8,
   "end": 19.36,
   "text": "And typically, you gotta pay points on the loan."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.68,
   "end": 21.34,
   "text": "And so points are essentially"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.34,
   "end": 23.98,
   "text": "like one percentage point of the loan."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.1,
   "end": 26.04,
   "text": "So if you have a loan for five, 400K, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.22,
   "end": 27.72,
   "text": "If you're gonna close that, typically,"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.72,
   "end": 29.32,
   "text": "they'll take not only the down payment,"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.32,
   "end": 31.08,
   "text": "but also some points on top,"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.34,
   "end": 32.9,
   "text": "just to make sure they're getting paid right off the bat."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.06,
   "end": 34.96,
   "text": "So the point may be, hey, we're gonna take two points"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.96,
   "end": 36.88,
   "text": "off of 400K, which would be $8,000."
  }
 ],
